# Airtel Network Performance & Customer Experience Analytics

A complete SQL + Power BI data analytics project that analyzes telecom network performance, customer experience, complaints, and usage patterns using a synthetic Airtel dataset.

## Project Title

**Airtel Network Performance & Customer Experience Analytics**

## Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing telecom network quality and customer experience using SQL for data analysis and Power BI for interactive dashboarding. The solution helps identify poor-performing locations, network issues, complaint trends, customer satisfaction, and 4G vs 5G performance through KPI-driven dashboards.

## Project Objectives

- Analyze overall network performance
- Compare 4G and 5G network KPIs
- Identify states and cities with poor network quality
- Analyze customer complaints and complaint categories
- Measure customer satisfaction and Net Promoter Score (NPS)
- Evaluate complaint resolution performance
- Understand customer data and voice usage patterns
- Build interactive Power BI dashboards for business decision-making

## Tools & Technologies

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| MySQL | Data analysis using SQL |
| Power BI | Dashboard & Data Visualization |
| DAX | KPI & Measure calculations |
| Excel/CSV | Source dataset |
| Git & GitHub | Version control & Portfolio |

## Dataset Description

The project contains **50,000 records** across five primary tables.

| Table | Rows | Description |
|------|------:|------------|
| Customer_Data | 10,000 | Customer master information |
| Network_Performance | 10,000 | Network availability, speed & latency |
| Customer_Experience | 10,000 | Complaints, satisfaction & NPS |
| Location_Analysis | 10,000 | State & city performance |
| Usage_Analysis | 10,000 | Data & voice usage |
| Date_Table | Calendar | Date dimension for reporting |

**Key Fields:** Customer_ID, State, City, Network_Type, Customer_Segment, Network Availability, Download Speed, Upload Speed, Latency, Call Drop Rate, Complaints, Satisfaction, NPS, Data Usage, Voice Usage.

## SQL Analysis

Example SQL queries used in the project:

```sql
-- Total Customers
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT Customer_ID) AS Total_Customers
FROM Customer_Data;

-- Total Complaints
SELECT COUNT(*) AS Total_Complaints
FROM Customer_Experience
WHERE Complaint_Flag = 1;

-- 4G vs 5G Performance
SELECT Network_Type,
       AVG(Download_Speed_Mbps) AS Avg_Download_Speed,
       AVG(Latency_ms) AS Avg_Latency,
       AVG(Call_Drop_Rate_Pct) AS Avg_Call_Drop
FROM Network_Performance
GROUP BY Network_Type;
```

## Power BI Dashboard

The report contains **4 interactive dashboard pages**:

1. Executive Summary
2. Network Performance
3. Customer Experience
4. Usage Analysis & Location Analysis

Each page includes slicers for **State, City, Network Type, Customer Segment, and Date**.

