| Avg Download Speed |
| Avg Upload Speed |
| Avg Latency |
| Avg Call Drop Rate |
| Customer Satisfaction |
| Avg NPS |
| Complaint Resolution Rate |
| Total Data Usage |
| Average Voice Usage |
| Average Tenure |

## Key Insights

- Compare 4G and 5G network performance.
- Identify low network availability regions.
- Detect cities with high call-drop rates.
- Monitor monthly complaint trends.
- Analyze customer satisfaction by segment.
- Track complaint resolution efficiency.
- Understand state-wise data usage patterns.
- Support data-driven telecom business decisions.

