## How to Run the Project

1. Clone this repository.
2. Import the CSV files into MySQL.
3. Execute the SQL queries from the `SQL` folder.
4. Open `Airtel_Network_Analytics.pbix` in Power BI Desktop.
5. Refresh the data model.
6. Explore the interactive dashboards using slicers.

